.claude/plans/PLAN-192/repass-rc1-20260918-NOGO-r1/verdict-rc1-1.txt:15:5. **Ledger writes are not confined against symlinks.** [`.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:132`](/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-rc1.Eh6UQ9/wt/.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:132) accepts a symlinked `launches` directory, and [line 174](/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-rc1.Eh6UQ9/wt/.claude/hooks/_lib/launch_ledger.py:174) follows a symlinked `launches.jsonl`, appending into its target outside the state directory. Condition 9 excludes deliberate same-user planting, so this is a follow-up under that threat model. **Minimal fix:** anchor writes to a verified directory and reject symlink/nonregular index destinations.
